Subject: [PATCH 4/5] fix(performance): cache do Bun nos jobs com bun install
 (SL-095)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Aplica actions/cache nos jobs de CI que executam bun install,
usando ~/.bun/install/cache com chave baseada em hashFiles('bun.lock').

6 workflows afetados: ci.yml (6 jobs), db-guard.yml, e2e-logado.yml,
e2e-talkx.yml, types-sync.yml. Teste E67 adicionado em
scripts/ci/workflow-contracts.unit.mjs para auditoria contínua.
